  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project &#x201c;Reversing the COVID crisis: municipalities as drivers of sustainable development&#x201d; has objective is to ensure that regional and local development are inclusive, evidence based and gender sensitive, and fully address development needs of the least developed municipalities whose communities have been most affected by the COVID-19. The expected output is: Innovative models for inter-municipal cooperation developed and tested as a tool for implementation of regional development policy an</narrative>
  </description>
